<title>USA: TRO Learning lands Iowa prison contract.</title>
<headline>TRO Learning lands Iowa prison contract.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>TRO Learning Inc said Wednesday it was awarded a contract with the Iowa Department of Corrections to install its PLATO learning system in six state prisons.</p>
<p>Terms of the contract were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The systems are part of the state's inmate literacy program. Two other Iowa correctional facilities are already using the PLATO system.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
